1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,560
Doctors turned this boy’s ankle

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,270
into a working knee.

3
00:00:03,310 --> 00:00:04,870
Wyatt had bone cancer.

4
00:00:04,910 --> 00:00:06,630
Surgeons had to remove his knee,

5
00:00:06,670 --> 00:00:08,250
but they could save his foot.

6
00:00:08,290 --> 00:00:10,135
They turned his lower leg halfway around

7
00:00:10,175 --> 00:00:11,750
and attached it to his thigh,

8
00:00:11,790 --> 00:00:13,920
with his toes pointing behind him.

9
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:15,380
That backward ankle now bent

10
00:00:15,420 --> 00:00:17,330
the same way as his other knee.

11
00:00:17,370 --> 00:00:18,430
When Wyatt woke up,

12
00:00:18,470 --> 00:00:20,330
he could still wiggle his toes.

13
00:00:20,370 --> 00:00:20,935
And once he learned

14
00:00:20,975 --> 00:00:22,140
to use his new leg,

15
00:00:22,180 --> 00:00:23,340
that same foot helped him

16
00:00:23,380 --> 00:00:24,620
kick a soccer ball.

